WEBVTT

00:30.870 --> 00:33.370
[You Have My Heart]

00:33.390 --> 00:36.210
[Episode 6: The Faceless Void]

00:37.100 --> 00:38.380
A mirror

00:38.550 --> 00:40.410
that reflects people for too long

00:40.660 --> 00:41.940
gains sentience

00:42.860 --> 00:45.430
and comes to believe it is human.

00:48.940 --> 00:49.740
Sadly,

00:50.350 --> 00:51.810
a mirror is still a mirror—

00:52.030 --> 00:53.160
it can only reflect,

00:53.350 --> 00:54.470
never possess.

00:55.100 --> 00:56.500
Absorbing human essence

00:56.520 --> 00:57.980
and imitating appearance

00:58.250 --> 00:59.320
is your instinct.

01:00.460 --> 01:01.850
Yet the more you reflect,

01:01.850 --> 01:03.650
the more frequently you change,

01:03.970 --> 01:06.700
until you eventually forget
your original form.

01:07.480 --> 01:08.010
I...

01:10.480 --> 01:12.170
I just wanted to be liked.

01:14.410 --> 01:16.490
That day, I saw her on the street.

01:17.840 --> 01:19.570
She had such a beautiful smile,

01:19.730 --> 01:21.530
and everyone was looking at her.

01:23.190 --> 01:25.220
So I naturally turned into her.

01:26.080 --> 01:28.390
Then why did you kill that maid, Wan,

01:29.070 --> 01:30.130
and disfigure her?

01:31.910 --> 01:33.140
I didn't kill anyone.

01:34.390 --> 01:35.550
Who is Wan?

01:36.350 --> 01:37.280
I don't know her.

01:39.770 --> 01:41.060
Why did you

01:41.500 --> 01:43.620
publicly transform your appearance
on the street earlier,

01:43.620 --> 01:45.220
causing such a disturbance?

01:46.390 --> 01:48.360
I... I don't know.

01:49.830 --> 01:50.740
It felt like...

01:51.430 --> 01:52.890
something was constantly

01:53.740 --> 01:55.110
pulling at me,

01:56.590 --> 01:57.550
forcing me.

01:57.950 --> 02:00.010
It forced me to change in front of you.

02:00.040 --> 02:01.240
I didn't want to do it.

02:02.580 --> 02:03.710
I was scared.

02:17.750 --> 02:19.910
Have you been to South Street recently,

02:19.910 --> 02:21.440
and gone near that old well?

02:22.400 --> 02:23.370
Two days ago,

02:24.100 --> 02:25.210
I was there.

02:26.060 --> 02:26.760
I wanted to see

02:26.760 --> 02:28.760
if there were more beautiful faces.

02:33.829 --> 02:34.740
Lord Bai,

02:35.290 --> 02:37.440
you've heard it and seen it.

02:38.110 --> 02:40.740
The scorched traces
of corruption are real.

02:41.040 --> 02:42.480
She is not the murderer.

02:43.360 --> 02:44.780
She is merely a poor spirit

02:44.780 --> 02:47.040
being controlled by scattered corruption.

02:47.040 --> 02:48.840
Do you have anything else to ask?

02:49.100 --> 02:49.910
I will

02:50.590 --> 02:52.320
question her myself tomorrow.

02:56.570 --> 02:58.860
[Dedication Above Self]

03:04.150 --> 03:05.080
My Lord,

03:05.410 --> 03:07.210
we have carefully examined her.

03:07.260 --> 03:08.660
Aside from her clothing,

03:08.690 --> 03:10.490
she carries nothing else on her.

03:13.780 --> 03:16.110
Defendant Mingyuan,
do you plead guilty?

03:16.740 --> 03:17.670
No,

03:18.000 --> 03:18.840
My Lord.

03:20.000 --> 03:21.230
I am not Mingyuan.

03:22.280 --> 03:24.940
In this court, deception
will not be tolerated.

03:25.270 --> 03:27.510
If you are not Mingyuan,

03:28.300 --> 03:29.270
then who are you?

03:38.300 --> 03:39.090
I...

03:41.600 --> 03:43.070
I am a mirror spirit.

03:44.810 --> 03:47.270
Humans admire beauty
and despise ugliness;

03:47.310 --> 03:50.100
day after day they stand
before mirrors to make themselves up.

03:50.100 --> 03:51.829
Over time, desire, ignorance,

03:52.610 --> 03:54.660
love, and resentment

03:56.070 --> 03:57.430
accumulate—

03:58.310 --> 03:59.630
and I came into being.

04:00.910 --> 04:02.510
I am formless and faceless.

04:02.970 --> 04:05.300
Only by observing others through a mirror

04:05.330 --> 04:07.330
can I take on their appearance.

04:09.190 --> 04:10.790
Taking on their appearance?

04:15.430 --> 04:16.500
Welcome to

04:17.149 --> 04:18.820
the real Yin-Yang Crossing.

04:21.620 --> 04:23.020
In broad daylight, then,

04:23.340 --> 04:24.470
transform once more

04:24.540 --> 04:25.780
for me to see,

04:26.510 --> 04:27.510
and thereby prove

04:27.670 --> 04:29.330
that what you say is not false.

04:35.780 --> 04:36.780
To prove it?

04:37.460 --> 04:40.720
Do you really think you're worthy
of seeing what I truly am?

04:57.830 --> 04:58.290
What...

04:58.450 --> 04:59.270
It's gone?

04:59.300 --> 05:00.450
I'll go beat the Liu Drum

05:00.450 --> 05:01.780
and invite Lady Fufeng.

05:13.030 --> 05:14.830
My Lord, hurry—strike the drum.

05:16.400 --> 05:17.600
What is going on here?

06:01.790 --> 06:02.490
Lady Fufeng,

06:02.490 --> 06:03.320
the demon has escaped.

06:03.320 --> 06:03.980
We...

06:04.350 --> 06:05.410
I am already aware.

06:05.870 --> 06:08.570
It was nothing more than a minor,
incompetent spirit.

06:08.570 --> 06:09.680
I have suppressed it—

06:09.680 --> 06:11.810
it won't be able to stir up any trouble.

06:22.360 --> 06:23.280
A minor spirit?

06:24.500 --> 06:26.260
You need not worry any further.

06:27.580 --> 06:29.690
My Lord, your complexion is quite poor;

06:29.690 --> 06:32.620
you must have expended
a great deal of mental energy.

06:34.190 --> 06:35.909
This place is crowded
and full of eyes and ears—

06:35.909 --> 06:37.570
not suitable for discussion.

06:37.620 --> 06:40.220
Why don't you move
to the inner chamber with me?

06:40.870 --> 06:42.800
I also have matters about this case

06:42.870 --> 06:45.270
I would like to discuss
with you in private.

06:51.990 --> 06:52.590
Very well.

06:53.220 --> 06:55.300
I, too, have many questions.

07:20.870 --> 07:21.830
Lady Fufeng,

07:22.040 --> 07:23.800
you have always been
sparing with your words,

07:23.800 --> 07:26.000
and you're never
particularly polite to me either.

07:26.000 --> 07:27.950
An invitation to the inner chamber—

07:27.950 --> 07:29.070
that's a first.

07:31.760 --> 07:34.320
How do I usually say it?

07:35.510 --> 07:37.370
Usually just one line—follow me.

07:44.760 --> 07:45.960
I've reflected on it.

07:46.440 --> 07:49.200
I was too condescending toward you before.

07:52.480 --> 07:53.150
What did you

07:53.880 --> 07:55.270
want to talk about just now?

07:55.270 --> 07:56.630
I want to talk about you—

07:59.270 --> 08:00.560
and what you're hiding

08:03.820 --> 08:05.060
in your heart.

08:06.410 --> 08:07.120
Liu Fufeng?

09:28.520 --> 09:29.010
My Lady.

09:32.330 --> 09:33.290
Lady Fufeng.

09:34.230 --> 09:35.520
So, in your eyes,

09:35.920 --> 09:36.800
that is all I am—

09:37.720 --> 09:39.780
someone who only ever says follow me.

09:41.710 --> 09:44.030
Since you already
sensed something was wrong,

09:44.030 --> 09:45.630
why didn't you call for help?

09:50.060 --> 09:51.520
I fear I will owe ever more,

09:52.040 --> 09:53.500
until there is no way back.

09:56.230 --> 09:57.030
Rest assured.

09:57.200 --> 09:59.060
Even if you hadn't asked for help,

09:59.950 --> 10:02.410
I wouldn't have stood by
and watched you die.

10:10.830 --> 10:11.630
Besides,

10:13.350 --> 10:15.010
I also wanted to see for myself

10:15.590 --> 10:17.250
whether she truly was a demon.

10:20.350 --> 10:22.200
So, Lord Bai—

10:23.280 --> 10:24.810
do you have your answer now?

10:25.160 --> 10:26.010
She is a demon.

10:27.950 --> 10:29.280
I saw it with my own eyes.

10:39.320 --> 10:40.380
And what about you,

10:42.570 --> 10:43.410
Lady Fufeng?

10:44.470 --> 10:47.200
You wield power
and govern these strange beings—

10:47.990 --> 10:49.320
so what exactly are you?

10:53.490 --> 10:55.060
Lord Bai, are you afraid

10:55.890 --> 10:56.690
of demons,

10:58.540 --> 11:01.990
or of powerlessness itself?

11:17.870 --> 11:18.400
My Lord,

11:18.920 --> 11:19.990
this spirit

11:20.020 --> 11:21.110
is adept at illusion and shape-shifting,

11:21.110 --> 11:22.110
and it has been deceiving people.

11:22.110 --> 11:23.520
It even made me fall flat on my face

11:23.520 --> 11:24.990
and nearly caused a major disaster.

11:24.990 --> 11:25.790
In my opinion,

11:25.960 --> 11:27.500
it should be destroyed on the spot

11:27.500 --> 11:28.900
to avoid future trouble.

11:29.040 --> 11:31.100
Constable Chen is absolutely right.

11:33.810 --> 11:34.440
My Lord,

11:35.510 --> 11:37.030
even if it is not destroyed,

11:37.030 --> 11:39.500
it should be immediately sent
to Xiqianhua Mansion,

11:39.500 --> 11:41.900
to be sealed and suppressed
by Lady Fufeng.

11:42.240 --> 11:43.280
Yes, My Lord.

11:43.390 --> 11:45.050
Please dispose of it quickly.

11:45.620 --> 11:47.320
Seeing her wearing Mingyuan's face

11:47.320 --> 11:48.650
gives me chills.

11:49.160 --> 11:50.040
And what if

11:50.230 --> 11:50.870
she turns

11:50.900 --> 11:53.110
into someone we know

11:53.320 --> 11:54.200
next time?

11:54.230 --> 11:54.940
Exactly.

11:55.560 --> 11:57.060
I beg you to see the truth, My Lord.

11:57.060 --> 12:00.420
I have only just gained sentience—
I would not dare to commit evil.

12:00.420 --> 12:01.900
You keep insisting

12:01.930 --> 12:03.040
you have done no wrong.

12:03.040 --> 12:05.520
Then why did you
attack the constables and me?

12:05.520 --> 12:06.370
Attack?

12:13.750 --> 12:15.200
I... I don't remember.

12:17.450 --> 12:18.770
At the time, it felt as though

12:18.770 --> 12:21.680
an overwhelming resentment and desire

12:22.400 --> 12:23.600
were controlling me.

12:23.990 --> 12:24.590
As if...

12:26.280 --> 12:27.870
as if a voice

12:28.280 --> 12:29.400
kept telling me

12:30.470 --> 12:31.310
that

12:36.320 --> 12:38.470
if I could take your heart,

12:40.800 --> 12:42.920
I would gain infinite power,

12:43.990 --> 12:46.710
preserve this most beautiful form forever,

12:47.520 --> 12:49.400
and even become stronger—

12:49.680 --> 12:51.480
no longer controlled by anyone.

12:52.560 --> 12:54.830
I truly could not control myself.

12:55.080 --> 12:55.870
Before this,

12:55.870 --> 12:57.630
I had never killed anyone.

12:58.200 --> 13:00.110
Since taking this form,

13:01.750 --> 13:03.560
I have only felt immense joy—

13:04.350 --> 13:06.280
I only wanted to wander the streets

13:07.200 --> 13:09.800
and see more beautiful faces and clothes.

13:10.350 --> 13:11.520
I love beauty only;

13:12.320 --> 13:15.720
how could I ever commit such ugly acts
as disfiguring others?

13:16.560 --> 13:17.080
Hu.

13:27.080 --> 13:28.280
Thank you, My Lord.

13:28.280 --> 13:29.990
I'm quite thirsty...

13:39.280 --> 13:39.750
Stop!

13:42.110 --> 13:43.680
This cup once contained

13:43.990 --> 13:44.920
a lethal poison.

13:51.130 --> 13:52.930
She is not the one who killed Wan.

13:53.520 --> 13:54.350
My Lord,

13:54.800 --> 13:55.930
how do you know that?

13:56.870 --> 13:57.680
First,

13:58.750 --> 13:59.950
her words and actions

13:59.980 --> 14:01.780
are entirely focused on beauty;

14:01.830 --> 14:03.440
disfigurement and poisoning

14:03.440 --> 14:05.560
are completely contrary to her nature.

14:05.560 --> 14:06.040
Second,

14:06.160 --> 14:08.200
if she already possesses
illusionary demon arts,

14:08.200 --> 14:09.950
why would she need mundane poison?

14:09.950 --> 14:10.560
Third—

14:10.860 --> 14:12.120
and most importantly—

14:12.560 --> 14:13.990
she does not even recognize

14:13.990 --> 14:15.710
this crucial poisoned cup.

14:16.350 --> 14:17.160
From this,

14:17.470 --> 14:19.400
it is clear she is not the murderer.

14:20.560 --> 14:21.420
Mirror Spirit,

14:21.710 --> 14:23.470
although you are not the true culprit,

14:23.470 --> 14:25.990
your shapeshifting
has still disturbed the public

14:25.990 --> 14:28.230
and constitutes wrongdoing.

14:28.560 --> 14:31.420
This court will transfer you
to Xiqianhua Mansion.

14:31.520 --> 14:34.780
Once the truth is investigated,
your fate will be decided.

15:03.750 --> 15:05.470
You knew this was a demon nest,

15:06.110 --> 15:07.640
yet you still dared to come?

15:14.270 --> 15:14.780
My Lady,

15:16.150 --> 15:19.080
there is something
I would like to consult you about.

15:19.610 --> 15:21.850
Whether demon or human,

15:22.390 --> 15:24.260
every action follows
its own traceable pattern.

15:24.260 --> 15:25.990
Yet your attitude toward me

15:26.280 --> 15:27.280
is inconsistent—

15:27.310 --> 15:28.630
full of contradiction.

15:28.630 --> 15:30.030
At times you want to kill me,

15:30.030 --> 15:31.630
at others you want to save me.

15:31.780 --> 15:33.360
Sometimes you push me into danger,

15:33.360 --> 15:35.420
yet at other times you reach out
and pull me back.

15:35.420 --> 15:37.080
I've thought about it carefully.

15:37.080 --> 15:39.710
It seems you never truly want me dead.

15:40.830 --> 15:42.630
Rather, you want me to stay alive,

15:42.630 --> 15:45.040
remain conscious—

15:45.330 --> 15:48.260
and do something for you willingly,
of my own accord.

15:52.470 --> 15:53.920
So, Lord Bai,

15:54.970 --> 15:58.700
what do you think it is I want you
to do willingly, of your own accord?

16:01.090 --> 16:02.450
I've thought long

16:03.120 --> 16:05.720
and hard and ruled out
all impossible answers.

16:05.990 --> 16:08.520
However improper it may sound,

16:08.880 --> 16:10.590
it seems what you want...

16:10.820 --> 16:12.370
is me as a person.

16:16.430 --> 16:18.370
The mirror spirit did not kill anyone,

16:18.370 --> 16:20.970
which means the true culprit
is still at large.

16:25.070 --> 16:26.800
I want you to uncover the truth.

16:29.730 --> 16:30.250
That—

16:30.760 --> 16:34.170
is the "willingness of your own accord"
I require.

16:39.760 --> 16:40.800
Lord Bai,

16:42.190 --> 16:44.000
what exactly is going on

16:44.880 --> 16:46.550
in your mortal mind?

16:47.910 --> 16:49.150
Worldly affairs?

16:53.650 --> 16:54.150
My Lady.

16:54.440 --> 16:57.960
I have already sent additional men
to search for Mingyuan.

16:58.590 --> 17:01.590
Although the mirror spirit
did not directly kill Wan,

17:01.730 --> 17:04.040
there must be a connection—

17:04.530 --> 17:05.810
it is not that simple.

17:09.210 --> 17:09.900
Lord Bai,

17:10.920 --> 17:12.069
stop overthinking

17:13.560 --> 17:17.280
and focus on the investigation.

17:22.450 --> 17:23.180
Yes, My Lady.

17:23.339 --> 17:24.470
I'll go at once.

17:27.410 --> 17:28.470
How embarrassing.

17:44.710 --> 17:46.770
The real Mingyuan is still on the run.

17:47.670 --> 17:48.960
And instead of going after the suspect,

17:48.960 --> 17:52.290
we're out here in the middle of the night
examining a corpse?

17:53.760 --> 17:54.760
D-Did she move?

18:02.040 --> 18:04.150
The yamen has a limited budget.

18:06.830 --> 18:08.520
The dead do not speak—

18:08.670 --> 18:10.660
but they are the most honest of witnesses.

18:10.660 --> 18:12.920
She must have had
something left unsaid—

18:12.930 --> 18:15.460
something she wants us
to speak on her behalf.

18:15.650 --> 18:17.630
Hasn't Boss Chun already said it?

18:18.350 --> 18:20.720
Wan stole Mingyuan's lover.

18:21.930 --> 18:23.410
Killing someone

18:23.440 --> 18:24.720
over a man?

18:25.190 --> 18:27.520
All this love and hate
between men and women...

18:27.520 --> 18:28.780
Mortals, honestly...

18:30.110 --> 18:31.150
Lord Bai,

18:32.690 --> 18:34.480
what exactly is going on

18:35.730 --> 18:37.730
in your mortal mind?

18:38.590 --> 18:39.870
Worldly affairs?

18:44.840 --> 18:45.970
You're not a mortal?

18:47.320 --> 18:49.380
I'm going to be apprenticed
to Lady Fufeng

18:49.380 --> 18:50.670
to learn magic.

18:50.880 --> 18:53.030
There are so many spirits
in Yin-Yang Crossing—

18:53.030 --> 18:54.820
why must it be her?

18:56.490 --> 18:57.620
Can they be the same?

18:57.850 --> 19:00.710
If I'm going to pick,
of course I'll choose the best.

19:00.930 --> 19:03.210
And then what? Back to the way
you were when I first saw you—

19:03.210 --> 19:04.470
doing nothing all day?

19:04.670 --> 19:06.130
Would that really be good?

19:07.040 --> 19:08.240
What do you even know?

19:08.320 --> 19:10.480
You think Liu Fengling

19:10.580 --> 19:11.820
is that much better than me?

19:11.820 --> 19:13.820
She just follows Lady Fufeng
around all day—

19:13.820 --> 19:15.150
"Master, Master."

19:15.290 --> 19:16.820
If I could stay by Lady Fufeng's side,

19:16.820 --> 19:18.260
I would be willing to wait

19:18.290 --> 19:19.890
until I'm a decrepit old man.

19:20.180 --> 19:21.530
Willing to what?

19:21.840 --> 19:23.300
To learn magic, of course.

19:27.990 --> 19:30.720
Don't tell me you also want
to follow Lady Fufeng?

19:30.750 --> 19:31.560
Let me tell you—

19:31.560 --> 19:33.190
this is first come, first served.

19:33.190 --> 19:35.990
Just because you outrank me
doesn't mean I'll back off for you.

19:35.990 --> 19:37.300
These injuries...

19:38.800 --> 19:43.060
they don't appear to have been inflicted
on the same day or by the same person.

19:45.670 --> 19:46.720
How can you tell?

19:47.940 --> 19:49.070
This is an old wound,

19:49.160 --> 19:51.310
likely inflicted 2 days before death.

19:51.890 --> 19:54.150
Right side deeper, left side shallower;

19:54.240 --> 19:56.040
the wound trajectory is smooth—

19:56.100 --> 19:58.160
consistent with an external attack.

19:59.110 --> 19:59.760
But here,

20:00.110 --> 20:01.630
left upper, right lower;

20:01.920 --> 20:03.650
left deeper, right shallower—

20:03.800 --> 20:06.460
the angle and trajectory
are nearly identical.

20:06.500 --> 20:08.700
This suggests a self-inflicted wound.

20:13.000 --> 20:14.320
How would a woman

20:14.820 --> 20:15.710
like her

20:15.860 --> 20:17.190
disfigure her own face?

20:18.950 --> 20:20.200
These should be calluses

20:20.200 --> 20:22.270
from years of zither playing.

20:23.830 --> 20:25.890
But Wan was just a rough servant girl—

20:25.940 --> 20:27.670
how could she know such skills?

20:48.320 --> 20:49.850
At this hour of the night...

21:13.650 --> 21:14.980
This humble woman, Wan,

21:16.380 --> 21:19.590
requests an audience with
the county magistrate
to seek justice.

21:19.590 --> 21:21.330
to appeal for justice.
